<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah suspects were arrested while transporting explosives near the Lebanon-Syria border, and Israeli forces carried out drone and air strikes that wounded six people and killed a Syrian operative accused of planning attacks from the same frontier. Israeli artillery and air attacks continue to target southern Lebanon, killing civilians during olive harvest activities and injuring others. The Lebanese health ministry reports thousands of deaths and injuries since the conflict began in March. The conflict, which started in October 2023, remains focused on border confrontations between Israeli forces and Hezbollah or Iranian-backed actors. 4,335 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQRjZ5c1VhOEU1bm81ODZoU2ZaRThnOWFGUGNSYVN1N3RETDY2NlRZYlhQdldnY041bFBSbnlpWlctbTM2UWZQZ2JKZXUwVnBYeXV5X0VuSjM2X2c2c1RGbV9zdkxzVTB1b21Ib0FnTW5sZnI1VWxoVUNaX2FENUR0eXlyT3hXRmlZb29xZG93SEJEN0MtNlpsbUNVQXk3RlgtNW1pQlJsS05JSi16REE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOOGtaczZIYlJyR0xQNHJIQlduYVY3VVFqc0dOVllxaXNKY056TThpcElFZGZFVTdlQlY3cnNLV3dOazBPUUZKa09WaGVKUGFKOFc4Z0psYldITHo4SmlCS3NtWkVrSjF6WWY2Ykd4ZjZkWUhYNmNVODhkTmxseDRDamdWczZxbU1PdktkRzJybkd1OEhvZTFUc3Z0SXhHVU1DZzJQS3ZxcDlGb2RXVmhSTWN0NU1lODJhYmF5RlhsaGtib2JQR2JDNWVTZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPcXJhVUtpRTh1eGNiZjFFbzJpdnl6RlFjbHNOSDZpbXN6SVF2b241U1lnb19POTh5RHctUTlWZGItMlhXU2M5SWpPdXJpRkpUcEJWR3RoSXI3MGM0VTBsdDB5YzJhSVh6N2xNWUVoTzVYdTFfS29zaXRRSXgwQXdXSWFxRWZ3UGtfTnZzMVI0d0l6MHBpclRTbk9oeUtMOWxpN1d1cF96WDRPTWcyaEl2UDhBQTJTZ3RK?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Ti